* graphics.library in the C900 dialect of an Amiga fd file, from AROS's
* graphics.conf.  Each function takes GfxBase first; the C functions are
* AROS_LH definitions named Graphics_N after their vector.  A function
* that keeps its register list is not implemented.
* DeinitRastPort(), in AROS a link library call, has a free AROS slot.
